# runtime research-output churn (issue #509)
scratchpad-*
kb/experience/
# The inspirations vault is RUNTIME data (forage writes notes here; the leap driver edits
# their frontmatter; write-yield rewrites _sources.yaml). The tracked artifact is the SEED
# at deploy/kb/inspirations/_sources.yaml, which the installer and forage.sh copy in when
# the vault has no registry yet — never over an existing one.
kb/inspirations/
# The strategy vault is RUNTIME data too: the four gate commands sync a doc per strategy
# (knowledge/sync.py:85 -> knowledge_dir/"strategies") as a best-effort out-of-tx side effect.
# Tracking it made every successful gate run dirty the checkout, which merge-back then refused
# (operator/mergeback.py:200 requires `git status --porcelain` empty) -- a self-inflicted
# deadlock: the factory blocked itself the moment it succeeded (#636).
kb/strategies/
# Obsidian per-user session state (pane layout, open tabs). The rest of kb/.obsidian/
# (app/appearance/core-plugins/graph) is shared vault config and STAYS tracked.
kb/.obsidian/workspace.json
kb/**/.sync.lock
*.sync.lock
.DS_Store
*.swp
